build
cmake-build-debug
cmake-build-release
# calib: NOT ignored in this fork.
#
# Upstream ignores it, which is why the .vcal/.tcal files were untracked in the reference
# tree -- and why a `git clean -dfx` there would have deleted the calibration this
# deployment depends on, silently producing uncalibrated data that still reported itself
# as calibrated. See README.pioneer-fork.md and PRODUCTION-REVIEW.md D2.
#
# Kept as an explicit un-ignore rather than `git add -f` so that adding a new board's
# calibration later is an ordinary `git add`.
!calib
!calib/**
*.o
*~

